*Heading
Two-element Chester-Anand u-p-mu Quad8 chemical-potential gradient smoke test
**
** Purpose:
** - exercise multi-element assembly for the generated mixed Quad8 UEL;
** - test shared nodes, free interior mu DOFs, and pressure coupling;
** - remain isolated from rubber, contact, and bending geometry.
